From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ninjacornix <milanvrankic@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 01:36:42 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(editor): give project setup one left edge

Labels, fields, buttons and the step header share the dialog's left edge.
App choices are one row each, with connections under one Advanced
disclosure. Fields share one style, the catalog failure reads plainly with
the raw output under Details, and a failed setup says it stopped. The
empty project list offers only its own two actions.

Joinery-only start screen and setup flow, not intended for upstream.
